<description>&lt;p&gt;A Mexican federal judge was arrested on U.S. charges of taking a $2 million bribe to free a drug trafficker linked to former Olympian Ryan Wedding. A man extradited from Mexico was sentenced to 20 years for a fatal shooting in Longview, and a suspected Sinaloa Cartel member was arrested in Metro Detroit with cocaine seized. Kidnappings of farmers and villagers continue, showing cartel grip on rural Mexico, while Ismael &amp;quot;El Mayo&amp;quot; Zambada, alleged co-founder of the Sinaloa Cartel, was sentenced in Brooklyn. The conflict recorded 37 battle-related deaths in 1996, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiyAFBVV95cUxNc3d2VFhsUzJucjhiOHdzTnBuU0VDNF9PcEV3c2VvQ2FlQ3lZM2k5VXF3TXlseFJaMDlkekVxT19GUHJvbG1VdHdfbmNRWi1MdU9zdXpGVjJCSkhXc0NOSXVseldlXzZvOU1NVlJmaFlqNUlkUkJFeHFPZ2ZIRjNkdE5vb2Ixd01LVGttWEluTTNnakkybGVtMlFfM2VHcGVqbzBFbWJWWDNFcWVTSmJGWFdmRWlVVG9tS3hpcmVtQ3Jpd04yRmdKeg?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiugFBVV95cUxQNnJnWlVMYkUwX0hPQjVtXzZnNzhBUDhwczhNdnB0dVA3OTJnYTExdnV6ZjRya3M1UUo2TXUyT1l6U0ZRZmh2eUVRNWtJMFBDY2pMQWhaNU9yNm9NWHZGU1UzY2N1TDhwTnh1UXVNNG1YNFBWR2FWZDEzV01mMW0wS1hOcE9hZU1hbFJiaHEtZ0o2SW84T3Q4NDlOYjRTcFdPRnE2SXIzMjFQVHA3UVNZbm1ZaTF2TDhZeXc?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiUkFVX3lxTE9taUVyMl92TXBObmV5SG1tTXJIbzJYWXdkb3ZWRjhSbmktWnkyWXQ3eXdHT19iTnRuT3ZRR3FvNVBHTnYtdmU1a3hqclREWHdsT3c?oc=5&quot;&gt;Instagram&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Daily News | Texas' Oldest Newspaper&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Lufkin Daily News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Shoreline Media Group&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/arti